Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)喂！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到现在你都跑哪儿野去了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个笨蛋！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还把小鸟也给卷进来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)啊，明里姐，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)没、没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}实在是迫不得已……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)既然是游马的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那肯定就是决斗的事了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}围绕决斗的大冒险啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么大冒险啊！给我反省，你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器](六十郎)春～！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六、六十郎爷爷！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这位六十郎先生的决斗庵用地内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战国时代的武将喜乐壮八的石像{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次被发掘出来成为了热门话题。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张脸 好像在哪见过…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[主持人]接下来 关于喜乐壮八{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[主持人]我们请六十郎先生来给我们讲讲。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)喜乐！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喜乐壮八究竟是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎样的一位人物呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 他可是个打仗的好手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与众多武将交战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打仗得来的财富 全都分给了领民们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可他自己却彻底过着简朴节约的生活{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这片土地上 他可是传说中的明君。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说中的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道 莫非是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 除了石像之外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说还发现了各种各样的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。这次发掘出来的，你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(六十郎)喜乐大人的宝物可真多。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！那是老爸的硬币。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)没错，不会错的。哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}指示 No.卡所在位置的飞艇地图也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}指向了决斗庵。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？ 那倒是早说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打、打扰了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 小鸟酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)真麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么非得本大爷亲自{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去找 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:01:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]这尊喜乐石像……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(闪闪)这家伙是… 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真 真的跟我一模一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:04:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙到底是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是Numbers！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喜乐。啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说 说 说 说话了～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果传说的主人是巴利安的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然就是闪闪的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 那家伙居然是那么了不起的武将…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(叫声)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 好险！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(叫声)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧～\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.03,0:04:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 终于。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:05:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于重获自由了嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你是 基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 等等啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我啊 九十九游马啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 上次真是多谢了嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 告辞了嘭。喂 喂…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉古）站住 你这家伙～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的身体 还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说 说话了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么石像会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉古）才不是什么石像。 我是基拉古。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)我也不知道啊但我被吸进{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座石像里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 在那边的 我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是南巴兹的精灵。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}南巴兹的精灵？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 基拉古变成了石像 石像变成了基拉古？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你这么说……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)我对你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是知道得一清二楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 那女的便当里的菜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是偷吃对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别小看巴利安的情报网啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难怪中午肚子总觉得没吃饱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是我啊。话说 这种事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能算你是那家伙的证据吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)忘了跟我的决斗吗 混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃我巨人手秘孔死爆无惚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那个 你真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 没错嘭 已经换过来了嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今往后 俺就是喜乐壮八嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}换过来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺啊 在石像里面一直等着嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着再次获得自由的那一天。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 没想到 喜乐壮八
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现在了俺面前嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说中的武将 喜乐壮八果然 好可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（好可怕）喂 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗中打赢那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他从我的身体里赶出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 我要为了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（好可怕）那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是拿着 No.卡的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.37,0:07:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然他持有 No.卡的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就只能上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然完全搞不清是怎么回事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但还是要上，决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思嘭。夺走俺自由的家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁俺都不会原谅嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，上了。决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)加油，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)加油，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻就归俺了嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺的回合，抽卡嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:08:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺召唤小狸猫砰砰嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(砰砰)砰砰……好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动叶子变化嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将 名字带有狸的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到这边来 子狸嘭嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 要来了。我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级2的子狸嘭嘭和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}子狸碳碳 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.64！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌与迷惘之世斩裂的智者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欺瞒世界吧 古狸三太夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是遗迹的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动古狸三太夫的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只影武者狸衍生物特殊召唤出来哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙的攻击力会和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上攻击力最高的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得一样哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(惊)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 只要俺的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有影武者狸衍生物在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古狸三太夫就不会成为攻击对象哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 攻击力不过才1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区影武者 我才不怕呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别小看影子嘭。 影。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺这就 回合结束哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦… 哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞 来啦！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把一张卡盖伏。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那张卡…》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚 咚 咚 咚 咚 咚 咚…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}砰！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 胡子？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎… 为什么是我的样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 啊？ 等…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！ 你这家伙!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛偷看我的卡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。这张盖伏的卡是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼 呼 呼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺从手牌特殊召唤深夜骑士的说嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的说嘭…。星光体！ 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.27,0:10:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我啊！ 我在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？ 你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我都说了我是游马啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我不好啦……你便当里的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炸鸡块 是我偷吃的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游……游马吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！你这家伙干了什么好事!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和游马……互换身体了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 哼 哼……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个冒牌货！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 哼 哼……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这具身体的主人是俺嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以俺知道嘭。那张盖着的卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是用来召唤这张卡的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有魔法·陷阱卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤多哆哆魔女嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多哆哆魔女)多——…… 多多！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就有2只等级4的怪兽……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺把拟声乌托邦和多哆哆魔女解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}释放？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 把守备力3000的嘟嘟嘟加莎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以攻击表示 上级召唤哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘟嘟嘟加莎)加莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 零…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来应该叫出霍普的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 俺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地里 复活托伊奈特哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 守护者之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1只怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺场上的怪兽1只的守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升解放怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么多哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺把托伊奈特解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘟嘟嘟加莎的守备力 提升200点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击表示有个屁用啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用攻击力 零的嘟嘟嘟加莎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击吧嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……但是冲击可是你自己吃下的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可就不好说了嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(古狸三太夫)嘭嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘭嘭嘭嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～!? 怎么会～!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺果然还是喜乐好啊嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 冒牌货基拉古！ 你这家伙到底
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要做这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺是喜乐壮八的……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影武者嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影武者？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么传说啊嘭。什么名君啊嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为俺打赢了仗嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了俺才成了传说的嘭!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是 俺这狸猫 变成喜乐壮八
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干的好事哒嘭！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马他们）狸…狸猫！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…原来是狸猫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还一直嘭嘭地说…。又是狸猫兽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狸猫居然是 No.众的精灵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺和喜乐的相遇是在战场上哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在激烈的战斗中迷了路的 俺这狸猫{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙救了俺哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺啊 为了报答那份恩情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得和喜乐一模一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当了他的影武者哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为替代 俺替他打仗哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺很强哦。俺是天才。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺让国家变强了哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连天下都能拿下哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可那家伙却……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喜乐竟然把俺给炒鱿鱼了哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是嫉妒俺的实力哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}后来 喜乐那个蠢货大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打仗输了就死了哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是俺来打的话那场仗绝对能赢哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活该哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺这只狸猫 在那之后也马上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就死掉了哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但回过神来 俺的灵魂就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被关进了那座喜乐石像里哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次又成了死者的替身哒嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当替身已经受够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺要变成真正的本尊哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！ 游马 打赢这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的身体夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 现在基拉古的灵魂不在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要打倒那家伙 就能拿到 No.卡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，狸猫啊，就像你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古那家伙确实有卑鄙的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也有小气的地方。是个讨厌的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙说得太过分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……但是啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知怎么就是恨不起那家伙来。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才没有那回事嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种家伙，完全恨得起来嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺的回合，抽卡嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古狸三太夫的效果发动嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.51,0:15:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将影武者狸衍生物特殊召唤嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺用古狸三太夫直接攻击嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一下！用影武者狸衍生物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 最后的影子 用影武者狸太郎君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.15,0:15:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你致命一击哒嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说嘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张盖牌是 不 那张卡是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了召唤多多多魔女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而盖下的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影子是不会迷惘的嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用影武者狸太郎君 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爆裂·逆转！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘭！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付一半生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我的墓地里将1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以里侧守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 将多多多河童设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多多多河童！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影武者狸太郎君战斗就先放一边吧嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔… 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺还有这张卡嘭》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖上一张卡 回合结束嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对要赢嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抛弃了俺的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次就来当俺的影武者吧嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:17:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也可不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一刻 将咚咚咚咔嚓反转召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力零做攻击表示！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 反转召唤成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚咚咚咔嚓的攻击力是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变成我和你的生命值之差！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值之差是 3500！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘎沙的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升到3500！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘟嘟嘟嘟嘎沙的逆转效果 还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方场上的2只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影子…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用嘟嘟嘟嘟嘎沙攻击古狸三太夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在啵！ 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千叠敷返！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有狸的怪兽战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将其攻击力数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就是俺赢了啵！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么啵！？那张卡是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的陷阱卡发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中的茶茶丸送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将发动了的对手的陷阱卡效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当作我的陷阱卡来使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 千叠敷返的效果由我来使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(茶茶丸)茶～呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏古狸三太夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 古狸三太夫攻击力份的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是 1000点的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我接下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:18:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火起来了 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怒怒怒砰沙——直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三度笠旋风！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 俺会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蓬太！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺……不是影子啊嘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺……俺……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是嘭太。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}殿下……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真怀念啊，嘭太。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这位是喜乐的殿下？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.35,0:19:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那果然，基拉格就是喜乐……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么抛弃了俺啊嘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那场仗从一开始就注定要输。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会 不可能啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:19:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西要是俺去战斗的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只顾着给领民施予财富的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看不惯的家臣们倒戈了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等发现的时候已经无能为力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蓬太… 哪怕只有你我也想让你逃出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！ 俺…不要啊蓬。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你能说出口啊蓬！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说一起战斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 一起…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺… 俺… 俺…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哭声)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蓬太…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把俺… 把Number兹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们拿去用吧蓬。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少算是赎罪…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔…。嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(蓬太)喜乐大人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能 有那种事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.94,0:21:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！ 呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.47,0:21:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住…住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 果然上当了被编的故事给骗得团团转……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这群家伙 全都被我耍了。你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马… 下次见面的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会打倒你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古！ 你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:22:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉古）我为什么会说出那种话……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（蓬太）蓬！

